  "document": "Yeh Gulistan Hamara\nYeh Gulistan Hamara is a 1972 Indian drama film directed by Atma Ram. The film stars Dev Anand, Sharmila Tagore, Pran, Sujit Kumar and Johnny Walker, with music by S. D. Burman. Dialogue and screenplay are by Wajahat Mirza. The films depicts a tribal community living on the border with China; the song \"Mera Naam Aao\" was considered particularly offensive to the Ao Naga community in Nagaland."
